! Workbench/CDE look for X11 / XWayland apps (xterm, xmessage, older Motif programs).
! Installed to ~/.Xresources; load with `xrdb -merge ~/.Xresources` at session start.
!
! Tengoku is a TrueType face, so X clients reach it through Xft. Core-font-only clients (very old
! Motif programs) fall back to fixed — that is expected, not a misconfiguration.

*background:            #a0a0a0
*foreground:            #000000
*borderColor:           #262626
*highlightColor:        #6688bb
*cursorColor:           #000000

XTerm*background:       #8c8c8c
XTerm*foreground:       #000000
XTerm*faceName:         Tengoku
XTerm*faceSize:         9
XTerm*internalBorder:   4
XTerm*scrollBar:        true
XTerm*rightScrollBar:   true

! Motif-era resources still honoured by lesstif/openmotif apps.
*XmForm.background:     #a0a0a0
*XmLabel.foreground:    #000000
*XmTextField.background: #8c8c8c
*shadowThickness:       2
*highlightThickness:    1
